      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "What is the additive inverse of $-82?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the additive inverse of the number $-82$, we change its sign by placing a minus symbol $(-)$ in front of it. So, we obtain \n\n$$\n-\\,(-82)=82.\n$$\n\nTo check our work, we simply add the inverse to the original number. If we're correct, we should get zero.\n\n$$\n(-82)+82=-82+82=0\\,✓\n$$",
